ationid": "96645166", "author": {"steamid": "76561198092140206", "personaname": "BatRastard", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198092140206/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1572, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 168, "last_played": 1628103550, "avatar": "f034450d279797c33d29555aef43ac2d9960e8e6"}, "language": "english", "review": "I think this is still kind of pre-release, so the final product may be much different... and I really hope it does end up so.  It's very unpolished and the movement/physics are wonky as hell.  Does not stack up to Helldivers or other games like that.  The knock-down mechanic seems like utter BS and is basically an automatic death sentence.\nThe game is 50% off right now and, I suppose, I spent more time playing it (~2 hours) than I would have gotten for $5 for most other sources of entertainment, but if you're looking for anything beyond a \"$5 game\" then I would look elsewhere unless this really gets polished up before official release.", "timestamp_created": 1627667056, "timestamp_updated": 1627667056, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.595559239387512207", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1636764099, "developer_response": "We appreciate your feedback! As an Early Access, we are still working hard to improve the game and will be releasing new content in the near future. We hope that you try ZCrew again once the patch is released. Thanks!", "app_release_date": "1608227830", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "96605262", "author": {"steamid": "76561197984304184", "personaname": "DistortedOne", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/distortedone/", "num_games_owned": 239, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_foreve